Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One more turn, that's\Nall I need in order to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,activate my monster reward\Ncard i'm sure you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,aware of what happens\Nafter that isn't that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,right pharaoh my winged dragon of raw will
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,return to the field and once this egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,god card makes its\Nappearance you're done my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,plan was foolproof You\Nmay have built a powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,defense by creating a clone of my obelisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the Tormentor, but I'll break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and not only will I defeat you, but I'll\Nspare your good side from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that when I lose life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,my weaker half loses a piece\Nof himself to the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall place one card face down. Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my Swallowtail Spike Lizard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it remains in defense\Nmode, I receive 1,000 life points each
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,turn And since I plan to use my life\Npoints To strengthen my winged dragon of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra This is just the boost I need To\Ncrush his obelisk the tormentor And
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,once his Egyptian god card is gone I'll\Nuse mine to finish him off All right, now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my move, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush this freak with\Neverything you've got, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And just make sure he doesn't\Nsummon that winged dragon raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you guys see that Yugi's\Ngot himself a dilemma here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think, if Yugi beats Marek, then\NMarek's good side goes to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As if a creep like Marek can\Nactually have a good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing but cause them pain,\Nand they should be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be nuts to think\Nwe'd trust you. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,get out of my friend Teya's head so Yugi\Ncan kick your evil butt once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.23,0:03:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to help\NYugi defeat my dark side,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I needed Teya's body to speak\Nto him because I'm unable to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you, we\Nwouldn't be in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, and for\Nthat, I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is still a way for Yugi to\Nprevent my dark half from winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he finds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He better, or we're all gonna be\Nheading to the Shadow Realm soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did I just doze off or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move, so why don't\Nyou attack me, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you realized that\Nyou're out of options?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh won't attack him\Nbecause he knows it will destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I put him through such misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent my rare hunters\Nto take his possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:04:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I even captured his best friends\Nand turned them against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he be so forgiving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how Merrick fused himself\Nwith his winged dragon of raw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've combined to form\None old powerful beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Merrick's\Nplanning to do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's building up his life points so when\Nhe merges with Ra, they'll be unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But that also means that Merrick\Nbecomes a monster himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving him all the\Nweaknesses of a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that could be our only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your final move, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place two cards face\Ndown. Then I'll summon Gazelle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Mythical Beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn. Not quite. It\Ndoesn't end until my Boghanian
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,takes 300 of your life points So\Nactivate your special ability, my beast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes a little more of your friend\Ninto the dark abyss of the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I promise I won't let you slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a few short\Nmoments, Yugi will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Maric can activate his Monster\NReborn Magic card to bring back Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This will come in handy shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I have other\Nthings to take care of!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll send whatever's left of your\Nfriend to the Shadow Realm with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Varric, just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but first, my Spike Lizard special\Nability grants me 1,000 life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:06:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll activate the magic\Ncard that will end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall bring forth my winged dragon\Nof Ra in its most devastating form ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian god Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll give up 1,000 life points\Nto activate Ra's special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my great beast of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his obelisk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are wide open.\NObelisk is gone. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did he come from, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were calling out your attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was activating a magic card to stop it\Nfrom destroying Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So I played Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I used it to revive Slifer\Nand save Obelisk. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He used one Egyptian god card as\Na shield to protect the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to Yugi to\Ncome up with a move like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved himself, at least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He said to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer was hit by Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And Obelisk escaped without a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Yugi's gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's smart, he'll tap into\Nthe true power of Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, it's his\Nonly chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Ra to\Nreturn to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My great beast may be gone, however I\Nassure you he'll be back. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,yes we will in fact my egyptian god\Ncard will return to the field sooner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,than you think watch i'm about to give\Nmy dragon a second chance by turning
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,back time and repeating my attack\Nagain and it's all thanks to this magic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise attack from beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I'll take\Nyour response as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to replay the\Nattack I just made against Obelisk. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi already blocked
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real cheap move, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Maric has another chance to wipe out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's defense with his\Nwinged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I must save Merrick before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, my winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra, this time you have no\Nway to defend yourself, Baro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the return of my Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's locked in that sphere of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct, and only I can release it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand back as I recite the\Nancient chant to unlock Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Great beast of the sky,\Nplease hear my cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform thyself from orb of light\Nand bring me victory in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Envelop the desert with your glow\Nand cast your rage upon my foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:10:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall merge\Ntogether with my creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,transferring my power to\Nthe winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,now all but one of my life points\Nwill transform into raz attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,prepare for my final\Nassault the moment is here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,i shall finally drain you\Nof your ancient powers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and i will rule as barrow this is our last
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,chance to stop it and save\Nmankind from his evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I plan to sacrifice every one of my\Nmonsters and transfer their power to Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,giving my beast almost\N7,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough to destroy Obelisk and\Nwipe out what's left of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can escape the fury\Nof the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card, Soul Taker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Seto, what card's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what Yugi needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,While it may grant\NMarek 1,000 life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it allows Yugi to sacrifice\None of Marek's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wonder which one of\NMarek's monsters Yugi will choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I think I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize that I can\Nsacrifice any monster I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.19,0:11:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you're\Ngoing to sacrifice Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything's possible, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Marek has merged with Ra,\Nwhen his monster goes, so does he.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This will never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh Your magic card is no\Nmatch for my winged dragon of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra, I never said that I was\Ntargeting your dragon. You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something better planned Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost I guess he's not gonna\Nsacrifice Ra Then what is he sacrificing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright I choose your\Nindestructible Egyptian god slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian god slime is\Nmade up of two monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll be making a double sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand\Nthe point of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor's special\Nability requires two sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to activate the\Nhidden powers of Obelisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, to wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When two monsters are sacrificed,\NObelisk's force becomes infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yugi can destroy\Nall of Maric's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never take down\Nmy winged dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for that, and\NI'll destroy you with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still time for\Nme to make one last move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my Bulganian\Nand my Spike Lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can add their\Nattack points to Ra! Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to your soul-taker magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I get a 1,000 life point boost,\Nwhich also gets added to Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Marek boosting the power of Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian God card's attack\Npoints have risen to almost 5,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That blowin' eyeball on your\Nforehead must be frying your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra's still weaker than Ovilus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra should have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I activated a magic card\Nto protect it, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Glass System.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you,\Nbut thanks to this cord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,only a monster with more stars than\Nthe winged dragon of Ra can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid your\Nobelisk doesn't qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So Ra was spared from obelisk's assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my monster is stronger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good try, but not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So now that obelisk's power is no longer\Ninfinite, it can be easily trampled by Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you missed your chance, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yugi's gonna lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to fall by\Nthe mighty hand of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I must save Master Merrick from\Nthe wrath of his dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this duel is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake the dragon up, Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical dimension!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a spellcaster to activate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician girl will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's only one part left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I must sacrifice two of my\Nmonsters, Gazelle and Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:15:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sacrificing an Egyptian god?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Obelisk has served me well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but I must give him up in\Nexchange for one last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, it was your powerful\Nwords that enabled me to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the only one who could\Ncontrol the evil within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm drifting away into the\Nshadows while his power increases
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, it is my sworn\Nduty to protect Master
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick I must not allow\Nhis dark side to prevail
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a fool to sacrifice Obelisk
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the power of your Egyptian god\Nmonster to protect you You have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have plenty left. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have every one of my\Nfriends to give me support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I still have the heart of\Nthe cards to give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My magical dimension card also allows me\Nto summon any spellcaster from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Yu-Gi's smarter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play my final card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Ragnarok!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch closely as my two magicians\Nunlock this card's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this great power is released,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster on your side\Nof the field will be crushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,including your winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you and Ra are fused\Ntogether, you will be destroyed as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but the devastation caused by your attack
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,will also destroy what's\Nleft of my weak side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look, the Shadows\Nhave most of him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack from\Nyou will finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Ra is gone, he'll still\Nhave one life point left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he's that weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the force of the Shadow Realm will\Nbe too strong for him to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.21,0:18:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow your inner evil to\Noverpower your good heart, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,merrick ever since your family\Ntook me in i pledged my word that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,i would serve you all my life i\Nlonged to be a tomb keeper like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you this is my chance to fulfill\Nthat wish by saving you master
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,attack me and break the promise\Nyou made to Isuzu by destroying our
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,brother What if our move does send\NMerrick's good side to the Shadow Room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead and make your move and crush
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,an innocent soul I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,hope I'm not too late
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to let Master Merrick slip into\Nthe shadows, I could never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I'm gone forever,\NI wanted to say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, I shall protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that fool doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice, but it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, please don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still time! Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness is here to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now!
